WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:05.530
I worked on that idea of yours for my song.

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:06.610
Do you want to hear it?

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:07.570
Yeah.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:09.190
You got your lyrics handy?

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:10.154
Mm-hmm.

00:00:10.154 --> 00:00:13.528
["MEET IN THE MIDDLE" PLAYS]

00:00:21.722 --> 00:00:25.710
(SINGING) Get in my car.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:29.310
I'll drive you through the Canyon,

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:32.490
breathe in Topanga for the day.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:40.770
When we reach the ocean and we can't go further west,

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:43.476
we'll keep on driving anyway.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:48.150
Now you go ahead.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:55.850
(SINGING) I'll take you down to Dollymount

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:58.085
and we'll [MUTED] behind the dunes.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:06.270
I'll kiss your mouth, all whiskey breath,

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:11.100
and then leave your heart in ruins.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.120
Sing with me.

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:14.070
(SINGING) Maybe we should meet in the middle.

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:24.690
Maybe we could find a little city no one knows.

00:01:24.690 --> 00:01:31.230
And if they just gave us a minute on our own,

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:33.300
maybe we could call it home.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:48.675
Forget the stars of Hollywood or big old houses in Bel-Air.

00:01:51.990 --> 00:01:57.560
I can introduce you to the angels of my city.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:00.380
Oh, we'll find them anywhere.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:12.980
I'll drag you around town by your ear still ringing

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:14.240
from the rain.

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:22.148
I'll buy you chips and tea and beer

00:02:22.148 --> 00:02:28.350
and then I'll crush your heart again.

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:30.225
Maybe we should meet in the middle.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:40.760
Maybe we could find a little city no one knows.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:45.101
And if we just give us a minute on our own--

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:53.790
minute on our own--

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:55.905
maybe we could call it home.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:03.470
Maybe we could call it home.

